<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.5 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.5 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction March 11 versus March 4  SUVK :</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   186/131	  365/344</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.07/No bids   3.27/3.25</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.07/accepted  3.28/3.26</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.06/	    3.25/3.25</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   670/nil	  800/371</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million  2,480/970	1,500/1,451</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 47,520 million markka, the STO said. @</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
